  {
   "id": "hero-of-fate-250886@3.1.0.13",
   "gameId": "hero-of-fate-250886",
   "displayName": "Update 3.1.0.13",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-11-10T06:44:47.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Warriors, this update fixes some bugs and brings you the feature you've been longing for, \"Auto Skill Upgrade\"!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Below is the detailed description of the update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[System added]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Added a switch to automatically select skills when upgrading.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Bug fixes]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Repair the bug that the victory music keeps playing after killing the boss in the endless mode of the Westland map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2、Fix the bug that using keyboard or handle operation can skip the unlocking of new characters and use them directly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "3、Fix the bug that after the player passes the endless mode and opens a new game again, the attributes of the monsters will inherit the attribute bonus of the monsters in the endless level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed the bug that fate points are not immediately refreshed when players upgrade if they use fate points to refresh their skills.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[System Adjustment]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fine-tuned the monster alert information in the Western Realm.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2、Optimize the display of player's injury",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Added the effect of flashing red on the edge of the screen when the player is hurt.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. The survival life of the treasure chest in the scene has been increased, and the treasure chest will disappear automatically after 1 minute.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
