  {
   "id": "hero-of-fate-250886@3.1.0.7",
   "gameId": "hero-of-fate-250886",
   "displayName": "Update 3.1.0.7",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-10-27T07:59:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you for your support of the game, everyone's feedback on the problem I have re-read, and will try to adjust as appropriate, this small patch update to adjust the level difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Specific update instructions are as follows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[System added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1, added the guardian spirit resurrection function, when the guardian spirit died, you can spend gold at the merchant or merchant to resurrect the guardian spirit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Added a new acknowledgement list",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[System Adjustment",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Weakened the attack power of charging centaurs, goblin cavalry, minotaurs and elf archers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Adjusted the color tone of some monster bullets to clearly differentiate them from the player's bullets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed the bug that the scroll bar in the level selection interface didn't move synchronously.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Repair the bug of not synchronizing the replacement button after the destiny tip.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3、Fix the bug of air wall and no angel in the endless mode of Westland map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
