  {
   "id": "hero-of-fate-250886@3.0.5.0",
   "gameId": "hero-of-fate-250886",
   "displayName": "Update 3.0.5.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-10-08T08:17:38.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Version 3.0.5.0 Update Notice",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello everyone, this update fixes some of the obvious bugs that people have fed back, as well as adjusting the monster refreshing adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BUG Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed the bug that attributes are deducted after selling buff skills.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2、Fix the bug that the bullets of magic monsters are not added to the intelligence of monsters.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3、Fix the bug that charging monsters have no damage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "System Adjustment",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Increased the number of tracking arrows.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Increased the auto-save of the last selected level and difficulty, as well as the auto record of pets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Increased the refresh range of monsters to 40 meters, i.e. monsters will be refreshed only after exceeding this distance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Skill upgrades can be refreshed with destiny points, starting at 5 points and increasing by 1 point after each refresh.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Added frame support for skill damage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
