  {
   "id": "hero-of-fate-250886@3.0.4.10",
   "gameId": "hero-of-fate-250886",
   "displayName": "Update 3.0.4.10",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-28T03:06:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Version 3.0.4.10 Update Notice",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hello Warriors, this update focuses on two new Guardian Spirits ~ and a new guidance system!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The content of this update is as follows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Add new guardian spirit \"Shiitake Mushroom\", requires 500 crystals to unlock.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Added new Guardian Spirit \"Artoria\", requires 1000 crystals to unlock.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Added crystal quests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Added guiding arrows for teammates' corpses and portals in the battlefield.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[System Adjustment]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "1、Rohenna's Blessing experience and gold acquisition has been adjusted downward to 4% per level.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. The numerical growth of leadership skills of all professions has been increased to a unified cap of 150%.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3、Optimize the burning effect of flame class skills, change to running frame map, so it can support the transparency of the bullet class",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Optimize and adjust the special effects of hellish flames",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4、4th level of arena difficulty 3 monster movement speed decreased",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
